{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215330","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1421533001:1":{"text":"다들 왜 이렇게 기분이 안 좋은 거죠?","source_cn":"大家为什么心情这么低落呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74504C071B43CBE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421533002:1":{"text":"진행자가 내가 합격 조건을 충족하지 못해서 탈락했다잖아! 이게 일부러 괴롭히는 게 아니면 뭐야!","source_cn":"主持人说我没达到合格的要求，我被淘汰了！这不是故意刁难人嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26D89CED880CD20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421533003:1":{"text":"쓸 수 있는 재료가 그렇게 작았는데, 그걸로 만든 손잡이가 그렇게 무거울 줄 누가 알았겠어!","source_cn":"就那么一小块能用的材料，谁能想到它做成握柄后那么重呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6F86C705FC6D03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421533004:1":{"text":"그럼 조각을 해서 무게를 좀 줄이면...","source_cn":"或许能通过雕刻减轻一些重量……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94778348E0BBBC13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421533005:1":{"text":"말도 마! 스승님과 스승님의 스승님이 조각을 하네 마네 한참을 실랑이하다 몸싸움까지 할 뻔했어!","source_cn":"别提了！我师父和师父的师父因为要不要雕刻这事吵了半天，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD3E0F6B9AC38E55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421533006:1":{"text":"결국 만들 시간이 부족해져서 이 상태로 제출할 수밖에 없었다고!","source_cn":"最后留给我干活的时间都不够了，我就只能这样交上去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97A1E16896A1FDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421533007:1":{"text":"이럴 줄 알았으면 혼자 하는 건데...","source_cn":"早知道还不如我一个人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x575B8A1B452BA87D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠达因":{"text":"장인 데인","source":"工匠达因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}